149 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 148 0 R
  /Alt (This diagram illustrates the pixel aggregation rules for Grassland Related Change (GRAC) when downscaling from a 10-meter resolution (DLTC 10m) to a 20-meter resolution (DLTC 20m). Each 20m output pixel is derived from a 2x2 block of four 10m input pixels. The diagram provides specific examples of how different combinations of input codes at 10m result in an aggregated code at 20m, indicating a hierarchical or priority-based aggregation logic. Overriding Rules: * Loss of coniferous)
  /A [<<
    /O /Layout
    /Placement /Block
  >>]
  /K [0]
  /Pg 2842 0 R
>>
endobj

